<title>USA: National Beverage sets stock dividend.</title>
<headline>National Beverage sets stock dividend.</headline>
<dateline>FORT LAUDERDALE, Fla 1996-08-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>National Beverage Corp said Tuesday it has declared a 100 percent stock dividend.</p>
<p>The stock dividend would be paid to shareholders of record on September 9.</p>
<p>National Beverage has about 9,200,000 shares outstanding. Following the payment date of the dividend on October 25, about 18,400,000 shares will be outstanding.</p>
<p>Company Chairman and Chief Executive Nick Caporella said the move would help &quot;improve the market liquidity for our common shareholders by increasing the float.&quot;</p>
</text>
